 "query": "I swung by the food court on my way over here ten minutes ago and grabbed a mango lemonade from that new boba spot by the main entrance, right? The worker manning the register had on the coolest hand-painted denim jacket covered in little hand-drawn cats and constellations, and we ended up chatting for a minute about how they do all the art themselves in their spare time after shifts. I almost missed the crosswalk signal on the walk over because a tiny fluffy corgi in a tiny sunhat trotted past with its owner, and it stopped to wag its tail at every single person waiting on the curb like it was running for local neighborhood mayor. I\u2019ve heard the extensions, wigs & accessories section right now carries pieces made with natural hair, nothing synthetic at all. I\u2019ve heard all the offerings there line up with a totally reasonable budget, nothing that\u2019s wildly out of line with what makes sense price-wise. I\u2019ve heard there are options that work for a specific color, no need to get into the exact shade right now, all the picks there work for what people are going for.",
